<title>UK: Eurofima adds 1.0 bln Lux franc to ten-year bond.</title>
<headline>Eurofima adds 1.0 bln Lux franc to ten-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond has been increased by joint lead managers Crdit Europeen, Banque Bruxelles Lambert SA and Banque Internationale a Luxemborg.</p>
<p> BORROWER   EUROFIMA</p>
<p> AMT   *3.0 BLN LUF   COUPON     6.0	 MATURITY    14.NOV.06</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  102.0     PAY DATE 13/14.NOV.96</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.875     REOFFER    =	   SPREAD	 5.73</p>
<p> MOODY	AAA	 LISTING    LUX	 PAY FREQ    =</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  AAA	 DENOMS (K) 50-250    PRAECIPUUM  0.175</p>
<p> NOTES     *ORIGINALLY LAUNCHED FOR 2.0 BILLION LUX FRANC ON</p>
<p>		03.OCT.96.</p>
<p>	    -- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
